<title>USA: Digital Biometrics renews line of credit.</title>
<headline>Digital Biometrics renews line of credit.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Biometrics Inc said Wednesday it renewed a $4.0 million line of credit with Norwest Corp's Norwest Bank Minnesota.</p>
<p>The renewal terms are the same as the past year's terms of the line of credit, Digital Biometrics said.</p>
<p>	   -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
